378 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I\054 the undersigned\054 Gr\351gory MUGNIER\054 Doctor in Marketing and Consumer Psychology and founder of Axone \046 Partners\054 a strategic and operational marketing consulting firm\054 and Fl\350che\054 a SEO\057SEA referencing agency\054 hereby certify that Ms\056 Qetsia Fontange attended the Communication Strategy and Digital Communication course\056\n\nQetsia is an exemplary student who actively and pertinently invests herself in each of the projects she has managed\056 She demonstrates remarkable maturity and creativity\054 which will serve her well in her future professional endeavors\056 Over the course of this year\054 she has also developed methodological know\055how and work autonomy that will enable her to succeed in the projects she is looking for\056\n\nRemaining at your disposal for any further information\054 please accept\054 Madam\054 Sir\054 my respectful regards\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 379 0 R
     /Pg 370 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
